{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Mistakes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mistakes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/4/e748cc4f95f4069313674f00bdbf40e0bf97828c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{-1} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660ff1e0287ca5f8ce4b580520caa88fb99fe052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - a^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is neither <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> nor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the quotient is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f65642f8f5116f6d5fd566e9ea27966ed1e60444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(1) } \\quad \\frac{-1}{a + 1} \\quad \\text{(2)} \\quad \\frac{1}{a + 1} \\quad \\text{(3)} \\quad \\frac{(1 - a)(a^{2} - 1)}{a^{2}} \\quad \\text{(4)} \\quad \\frac{-(a + 1)}{2a} \\quad \\text{(5) none of the above}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"665\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b493e0e59f144bb79104e344f780a50d03420f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{-1} = \\frac{1}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"38\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc4c2452537d917fe63e31dfefe354590d0109a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{a} - 1}{a - \\frac{1}{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"49\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>Multiplying the numerator and denominator by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff9d5a35d7f6de4903b52e73c7e790f26b9231d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 - a}{a^{2} - 1} = \\frac{-1(a - 1)}{(a - 1)(a + 1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"193\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a573bcdc82b68dec357e5f0154e4b31d64c18aac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf{(1)} \\frac{-1}{a + 1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"102\" height=\"51\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mistakes\">Mistakes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Mistakes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem should also exclude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 660/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 304/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2439/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.402      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.402      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36274:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041732 and revision id 281155. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}